1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,360
Nelson Mandela spent 30 years in prison. He was in prison from 1964 until 1990.

2
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:12,640
He became the president of South Africa, and he still was on the United States terror watch list until 2018.

3
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:17,900
Until 2008. We had a black president here, and he was still on the terror list.

4
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:20,620
He had been the president of a state. He'd been hailed around the world.

5
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:24,180
He'd been at the Olympics. Everybody loved him. Everybody pretended that they didn't criminalize.

6
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,420
And he was still on our country's terror list.

7
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:29,440
So we got to be real careful about who we call a terrorist.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,920
We got to be real mindful of how we use that language of terror, because one person's terrorist is another person's freedom fighter.

